title: Shuffle Leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0 and difficulty >= 0
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 8;
card-image: img/Logo_PPS.jpg
go-to: rm_main

Changing the leadership of the party is painful, but perhaps it is necessary to adapt to changing circumstances.

Removing advisors will increase dissent from their faction of the party, while selecting advisors will increase a faction's strength.

- @rm_main: Remove advisors
- @add_advisors: Add advisors
- @remove_none: Don't change advisors.
- @easy_discard


###################### removing leaders

@rm_main
title: Remove advisors.
tags: center_advisor, internationalist_advisor, labor_advisor, international_advisor, nonfactional_advisor 
frequency: 1

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add advisors

@remove_none
title: Stop changing advisors.
go-to: root
tags: remove_advisor

@remove_daszynski
title: Remove Daszyński
view-if: daszynski_advisor = 1
tags: remove_dvisor
on-arrival: daszynski_advisor = 0; center_dissent += 5; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: rm_main

Daszyński has been removed as an advisor. The Centrist faction disapproves.

@remove_niedziawkowski
title: Remove Niedziałkowski
view-if: niedziawkowski_advisor = 1
on-arrival: niedziawkowski_advisor = 0; center_dissent += 5; n_advisors -= 1
tags: remove_advisor
go-to: rm_main

Niedziałkowski has been removed as an advisor. The Centrist faction disapproves.

# labor

@remove_barlicki
title: Remove Barlicki
view-if: severing_advisor = 1
tags: remove_advisor
on-arrival: severing_advisor = 0; labor_dissent += 5; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: rm_main

Moraczewski has been removed as an advisor. The Labor faction disapproves.

