####################### adding advisors

@add_advisors
title: Add advisors
choose-if: n_advisors < 3
unavailable-subtitle: Maximum of 3 advisors.
go-to: advisor_menu

@advisor_menu
title: Add other advisors.
tags: center_advisor, internationalist_advisor, nationalist_advisor, labor_advisor, nonfactional_advisor
frequency: 1


- @centrist: Add Centrists
- @internationalist: Add Internationalists
- @nationalist: Add Nationalists
- @labor: Add Labor
- @nonfactional: Add non-factional advisors
- @rm_main: Remove advisors instead.
- @remove_none: Stop changing advisors.

@centrist
subtitle: Reduces dissent regularly for each advisor appointed due to trust in leadership.
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #center_advisor

@nationalist
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #nationalist_advisor

