view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #internationalist_advisor

@labor
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #labor_advisor

@nonfactional
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #nonfactional_advisor

@add_daszynski
title: Ignacy Daszyński
subtitle: Ignacy Daszyński is the co-founder of the PPS and was the brief and first prime minister of independent poland. He is an excellent orator known for his attracting speeches. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Clear the Agenda, Party Discipline, Emergency Fundraising, Mediate Coalition Dissent, Cabinet ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/DaszyńskiIgnacy.jpg
tags: center_advisor
view-if: daszynski_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and centrists_resign = 0
on-arrival: daszynski_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Ignacy Daszyński is now an advisor.

@add_niedziawkowski
title: Mieczysław Niedziałkowski
subtitle: Mieczysław Niedziałkowski is the long-time editor-in-chief of Robotnik, our party newspaper. He is also a writer and advocate of socialism and stable polish politics. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Media, Editorial Line ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/NiedziałkowskiMieczysław.jpg
tags: center_advisor
view-if: niedziawkowski_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and centrists_resign = 0
on-arrival: niedziawkowski_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Mieczysław Niedziałkowski is now an advisor.

# nationalist

@add_severing
title: Jędrzej Moraczewski
subtitle: Jędrzej Moraczewski is one of the PPS leaders. He is staunch supporter of Piłsudski. The Left and Right are welcoming to him {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Party Discipline, Negotiating with the Peasants and Right, Negotiating with the President ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/MoraczewskiJędrzej.jpg
tags: reformist_advisor
view-if: moraczewski_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: moraczewski_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; nationalist_strength += 5
go-to: advisor_menu

Jędrzej Moraczewski is now an advisor.

